    }
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l01",
      "at": 0.3,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "i01",
      "text": "Five days. The fields are a long walk from her lane."
    },
    {
      "id": "l02",
      "at": 4.8,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "i02",
      "text": "She found the one with the right green rows in it."
    },
    {
      "id": "l03",
      "at": 9.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "i03",
      "text": "It took her a while to go in."
    },
    {
      "id": "l04",
      "at": 12.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "i04",
      "text": "Please, she said. Just one. I can't pay today, but I will."
    },
    {
      "id": "l05",
      "at": 18.4,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "i05",
      "text": "The farmer looked at her for a long moment."
    },
    {
      "id": "l06",
      "at": 22.6,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "i06",
      "text": "And he said no."
    },
    {
      "id": "l07",
      "at": 25.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "i06",
      "text": "Not unkindly. He had his own children to feed. But no."
    },
    {
      "id": "l08",
      "at": 31.4,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "i07",
      "text": "So she turned around and started the long walk home with an empty bag."
    },
    {
      "id": "l09",
      "at": 38.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "i08",
      "text": "Halfway back, it began to rain."
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "at": 41.6,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "i09",
      "text": "She did not run. She was too tired to run."
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "at": 46.4,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "i10",
      "text": "And then, behind her, somebody called her name."
    }
  ]
}
